    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d631">

                <pb facs="1049" n="953" sameAs="frus:frus1874/pg953"/>

                <head>No. 629.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">General Sickles to Mr. Fish.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States Legation in Spain</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1873-11-19"><hi rendition="#italic">November</hi> 19, 1873</date>.
                        (Received December 15.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 847.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to forward herewith, for the
                    completion of the series of communications passed between Mr. Carvajal and
                    myself in the affair of the Virginias, a copy of the private note to the
                    minister, written at the foreign office on the afternoon of the 6th instant, and
                    referred to in my dispatch No. 804.</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c,</p>
                <closer><signed>D. E. SICKLES.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d631-a1.xml" xpointer="d631-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
